{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Libertine is a narrative-rich roguelike card game set in the bowels of an illegal underground casino, where the house always takes its cut - in flesh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729390/extras/Screenshot_3.jpg?t=1749841470\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Face off a series of diverse characters in stressful blackjack duels, wagering both chips and the fingers off your hand. Each opponent you face is more than a set of cards. Study each of their personalities and playstyles, learn their tells, and read their intentions with each raise, check, and fold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729390/extras/Screenshot_2.jpg?t=1749841470\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Strategize, bluff and pray luck is on your side. But no matter what, never forget - The house always wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729390/extras/BB_Items.gif?t=1749841470\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3729390?t=1749841470","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3729390?t=1749841470","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729390/79bc5cb36a28e1cc7fc5f3ec02da7012797ffb4d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749841470","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729390/79bc5cb36a28e1cc7fc5f3ec02da7012797ffb4d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749841470","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable wit